#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Under libc4 and libc5 the millitm field is meaningful.  But glibc2 is "
#| "buggy and returns 0 there; glibc 2.1.1 is correct again."
msgid ""
"Early glibc2 is buggy and returns 0 in the I<millitm> field; glibc 2.1.1 is "
"correct again."
msgstr ""
"Na libc4 e libc5, o campo millitm é significativo. Mas glibc2 tem erro e "
"retorna 0 lá; glibc 2.1.1 está correta novamente."

